---
import Page from "@layouts/Page.astro";
---

<Page path={Astro.url.pathname} title="Privacy Policy">
	<Fragment slot="head">
		<link rel="dns-prefetch" href="https://seikoso.pythonanywhere.com" />
		<link rel="prefetch" href="/" crossorigin="anonymous" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" />
	</Fragment>

	<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
	<p>Last updated: <time datetime="2026-10-11">October 11th, 2026</time></p>

	<h3>Data Collection and Use</h3>
	<p>We store hashed IP addresses and hardware IDs (HWIDs) to ensure the security of our service. This includes authentication, preventing abuse, and enforcing bans. We do not process or share your personal data beyond what is necessary for security purposes. All data handling is based on our <i>legitimate interest</i> <a href="https://gdpr-info.eu/art-6-gdpr/" rel="noreferrer noopener nofollow" target="_blank">(Article 6(1)(f) GDPR)</a> in maintaining the safety of our service.</p>

	<h3>Retention</h3>
	<p>We retain this data for up to 90 days in order to fulfill these purposes.</p>
	<p>Following exceptions apply:</p>
	<ul>
		<li><strong>Premium access:</strong> Certain information necessary to maintain or verify a lifetime key may be retained for as long as necessary for that purpose, subject to applicable data protection requirements.</li>
		<li><strong>Blacklists:</strong> Information necessary to enforce a blacklist may be retained for as long as necessary and proportionate to the security purpose, subject to applicable data protection requirements.</li>
	</ul>

	<h3>User Rights</h3>
	<p>You may request access to or deletion of your data. Please note:</p>
	<ul>
		<li>If you are blacklisted, certain information may need to be retained to enforce the blacklist and protect the service. Any deletion request will be assessed in accordance with applicable data protection laws.</li>
		<li>If you have premium access, deleting data will automatically revoke your access to our premium services, perks and lifetime key. Premium-related requests must be handled manually. Please open a ticket in our support server or email <a href="mailto:privacy@nullfire.dev">privacy@nullfire.dev</a> before proceeding.</li>
	</ul>
	<p>To request the deletion of your data, visit <a href="https://seikoso.pythonanywhere.com/data" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener nofollow">https://seikoso.pythonanywhere.com/data</a>.</p>

	<h3>Contact</h3>
	<p>If you have any questions, concerns, or requests regarding this Privacy Policy or our handling of your personal data, please contact us at:</p>
	<ul>
		<li>Email: <a href="mailto:privacy@nullfire.dev">privacy@nullfire.dev</a></li>
		<li>Discord: <a href="https://discord.gg/bNuJfzANUV" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">NullFire Server</a></li>
	</ul>

	<br />
	<p>Copyright (c) 2024-2026 maxxus and contributors</p>
</Page>
